                                                "sense_id": "7214dfc8-3f15-3128-a4a8-4805a99f879e",
                                                "text": "Then, three workmen throwing dice for drinks. And their heads come sharply together as they count the scores. And so violently do they throw the dice that they shoot off \"the zinc\" on to the floor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d66a3ce-2d4e-4d22-8795-4e9f5bc48750",
                                                "sense_id": "7214dfc8-3f15-3128-a4a8-4805a99f879e",
                                                "text": "Even if there were a Chef and Brewer near Marble Arch, the name suggests a pint and pie, not a prawn and tomato sandwich and “a dock glass of white port off the zinc”; i.e., a small glass of a fine aperitif, at the counter […]"
                                            }
